# CR 701.8: Addle chooses a color, then its sub-ability's target player
# discards a card of that color the caster picks (Mode$ RevealYouChoose,
# DiscardValid$ Card.ChosenColor -- CardStateProperty.java:58-59). The
# target is chosen when the spell is cast; red is chosen on resolution, so
# only Lightning Bolt and Shock are offered, and the caster takes Shock.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 2 B
tapformana human 3 B
queue paygeneric B
queue targets ai
queue colorchoice R
queue cardchoice 5
castspell human 1
resolvestack
